    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../../mapping/model/CachingValueExpressionEvaluatorFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>CachingValueExpressionEvaluatorFactory</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/ExpressionParser.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>ExpressionParser</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/EnvironmentCapable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment provider</code></a> and <a href=\"../EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> with a specific\n<code>cacheSize</code>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/ExpressionParser.html\" title=\"类或接口 in org.springframework.expression\"><code>ExpressionParser</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/EnvironmentCapable.html\" title=\"类或接口 in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment provider</code></a>和<a href=\"../EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"接口 in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a>创建一个具有特定<code>cacheSize</code>的新<a href=\"../../mapping/model/CachingValueExpressionEvaluatorFactory.html\" title=\"类 in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>CachingValueExpressionEvaluatorFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../../mapping/model/CachingValueExpressionEvaluatorFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>CachingValueExpressionEvaluatorFactory</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/ExpressionParser.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>ExpressionParser</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/EnvironmentCapable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment provider</code></a> and <a href=\"../EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> with a cache size of 256.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/ExpressionParser.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.expression\"><code>ExpressionParser</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/EnvironmentCapable.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment provider</code></a>和<a href=\"../EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a>创建一个缓存大小为 256 的新<a href=\"../../mapping/model/CachingValueExpressionEvaluatorFactory.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>CachingValueExpressionEvaluatorFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A reactive <a href=\"../EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> that assembles an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> from a list of\n<a href=\"../spi/ReactiveEvaluationContextExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel.spi\"><code>ReactiveEvaluationContextExtension</code></a> and <a href=\"../spi/EvaluationContextExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel.spi\"><code>EvaluationContextExtension</code></a> instances.",
      "translation": "一个反应式的<a href=\"../EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.spel 中的接口\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a>，它从一组<a href=\"../spi/ReactiveEvaluationContextExtension.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.spel.spi 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveEvaluationContextExtension</code></a>和<a href=\"../spi/EvaluationContextExtension.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.spel.spi 中的接口\"><code>EvaluationContextExtension</code></a>实例中组装一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.expression 中的类或接口\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../../repository/query/QueryMethodValueEvaluationContextAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>QueryMethodValueEvaluationContextAccessor</code></a> from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"../../repository/query/QueryMethodValueEvaluationContextAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>QueryMethodValueEvaluationContextAccessor</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "An <a href=\"../EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> that assembles an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> from a list of\n<a href=\"../spi/EvaluationContextExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel.spi\"><code>EvaluationContextExtension</code></a> instances.",
      "translation": "一个 <a href=\"../EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.spel 中的接口\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a>，它从一组 <a href=\"../spi/EvaluationContextExtension.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.spel.spi 中的接口\"><code>EvaluationContextExtension</code></a> 实例组装出一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.expression 中的类或接口\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
