    {
      "source": "Create a default <a href=\"../EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> (or subclass) from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/ListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ListableBeanFactory</code></a>.",
